# jsDelivr Scripts — Footer Only (CRITICAL)

**NEVER** move, relocate, or convert jsDelivr `<script>` links or `<script type="importmap">` blocks out of the **Before `</body>`** (footer) custom code into the **`<head>`** tag.

All jsDelivr scripts **MUST** remain permanently inside the **Before `</body>`** tag.

## Forbidden

```html
<!-- ❌ NEVER in <head> -->
<script type="importmap">…</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Staylow-flow/lowtideflow-assets@…/js/ltf.js"></script>
<script type="module" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/…"></script>
```

## Required

```html
<!-- ✅ ONLY in Before </body> (footer custom code) -->
<script type="importmap">…</script>
<script type="module" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Staylow-flow/lowtideflow-assets@<commit>/js/ltf.js"></script>
```

## Head vs footer split

| Location | Allowed |
|----------|---------|
| **`<head>`** | CSS (`<style>`), `:root` tokens, `@keyframes`, layout cages — **no jsDelivr scripts, no importmaps** |
| **Before `</body>`** | All jsDelivr `<script>` tags, importmaps, module entry points |

When deploying via Webflow MCP, use `location: "footer"` for any jsDelivr or importmap content. Never use `location: "head"` for scripts.
